{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>比利時爆發全國大罷工，抗議政府緊縮政策。</p><p></p><p>比利時首都布魯塞爾有數萬人上街，有人焚燒汽車和雜物。防暴警察到場，開水炮滅火和驅散人群。今次全國大罷工由工會發起，抗議生活開支高企，以及政府的緊縮政策。</p><p></p><p>布魯塞爾機場表示，由於部分航空交通管制員打算參加罷工，周一大部分航班都會取消。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T22:22:23.429646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T22:30:09.269251+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T22:15:36.906412+00:00","content_hash":"c159683001a5812feaa6d6d23470d6d6dff8b842ecc0436a5a26b4123d49a8ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T22:22:23.429646+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}